So we have something in the zeroth position, and then whenever we generate a token,

02:02:39.880 --> 02:02:44.120
we're going to take the information from the zeroth position

02:02:44.120 --> 02:02:45.480
and then we're going to add one to it.

02:02:45.480 --> 02:02:47.560
