02:02:54.600 --> 02:02:55.800
And then we have this three.

02:02:55.800 --> 02:02:56.680
And we make it four.

02:02:57.800 --> 02:02:59.000
So that's pretty much what this doing.

02:02:59.000 --> 02:03:04.600
Let's just keep concatenating more tokens onto it.

02:03:04.600 --> 02:03:08.040
And then we, you know, after this loop, we just return the index.

02:03:08.040 --> 02:03:11.640
So this is all the generated tokens for max new tokens.

02:03:11.640 --> 02:03:15.080
