02:05:55.320 --> 02:05:56.760
It's not really anything more than that.

02:05:56.760 --> 02:06:00.920
It can just be bigger based on the amount of bits that it occupies.

02:06:01.720 --> 02:06:05.640
So that's just an overview on torch.long.

02:06:05.640 --> 02:06:08.120
